[
  {
    "start": 0,
    "duration": 12,
    "text": "[音乐]",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 12,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "看新闻 开视野",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 14,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "欢迎收看今天9月22号的公视手语新闻",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 19,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "首先来关心",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 22,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "第18号强烈台风划加沙",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 26,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "中心目前位在俄伦比东南方的海面",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 30,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "精明两天将会通过巴士海峡",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 35,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "而气象署持续发布海上路上台风警报",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 40,
    "duration": 8,
    "text": "警戒的区域包括台东 屏东 恒春半岛和高雄地区",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 48,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "而基隆北海岸 宜兰还有花莲",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 54,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "虽然不在暴风圈内",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 56,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但由于台风外围环流宽广",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 59,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "雨势也会很明显",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 62,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "接着来看气象署的最新说明",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 66,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "在清晨6点的时候",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 71,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "台风中心已经来到",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 72,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "俄伦比东南东方大约400公里的海面上",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 75,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "它的暴风圈在减清晨5点的时候",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 78,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "已经接触到我们东南部的近海",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 80,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "预估未来还是偏西的方向通过巴士海峡",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 84,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在今天晚上会到达我们南端的海面",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 87,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "到明天清晨以后到达西南端的海面",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 90,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "所以今天到明天将是华嘉沙台风最接近我们的时候",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 94,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "目前资料研判",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 95,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "华嘉沙台风的强度还可能有机会再增强一些些",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 100,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而目前我们发布海上路上警报",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 102,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "海上警报区域是台湾东南部海面",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 105,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "巴士海峡 东沙岛海面以及台湾海峡南部",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 109,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "路上警报区域则是恒川半岛 台东 屏东和高雄",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 115,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "从今天晚上到明天",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 117,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "6米的浪高会影响到我们东半侧的海面",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 120,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "巴士海峡 甚至台湾海峡南部",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 123,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而台风中心更会有10米以上的浪高",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 126,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "根据最新预报资料",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 128,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "气象署可能在7点的时候",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 130,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "针对台东的濱海乡镇以及恒川",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 133,
    "duration": 7,
    "text": "还有屏东的满洲牡丹发布有可能达到6米浪高的巨浪告紧",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 140,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "提醒这些朋友们",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 141,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "沿海地区可能会有这样的巨浪",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 143,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "今天晚上到明天雨势作为加注",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 146,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "同样提醒大家",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 147,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "明天豪雨淘宝区域会更为的宽广",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 150,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "尤其可能出现豪雨以上等级区域",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 153,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "预估明天在整个东半部沿海",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 155,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "东半部地区 恒川半岛 高平 山区 平地",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 160,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "以及其他各地的山区可能会出现大雨或豪雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 164,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "尤其是花东地区 宜兰山区 屏东山区 高雄山区",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 170,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "可能会有豪雨以上等级的降雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 173,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "可以看到整个平均风8到9级",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 175,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "正风10到11节区域会逐渐地扩展到整个台南海峡",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 180,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "东南部海面 以及我们南端的海面",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 182,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其他海面的风浪也很强",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 184,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "沿海地区也都这样",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 186,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "所以气象署持续发布陆上强风特报的告警的灯号",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 190,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "气象署提醒大家要特别留意",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 192,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "注意自己的安全",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 194,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "华家沙外围环流恐怕带来强风豪雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 199,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "今天停班停课的地区",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 201,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "包括屏东县的六个乡镇",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 205,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "以及台东的绿岛和蓝雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 210,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "此外花莲 马太安溪 晏瑟湖",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 214,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "可能会出现溢流风险",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 217,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "花莲县府昨天已经启动预防性撤离",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 222,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "附近的三所学校也都停班停课",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 227,
    "duration": 6,
    "text": "强烈台风华家沙持续增层",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 233,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "暴风圈范围再度扩大",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 235,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "清晨以每小时21公里的速度往西推进",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 239,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "七级风平均暴风半径达到320公里",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 242,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "气象署也将警戒区域",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 244,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "进一步纳入台东 屏东",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 246,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "恒春半岛以及高雄地区",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 248,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "东半部以及北部还有恒春",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 250,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "可能会有局部性的大雨或豪雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 252,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "整个范围都扩大了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 254,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "另外沿海都有可能会出现",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 256,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "八到九级以上的强震风",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 258,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也要注意长浪",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 260,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "另外西半部沉降区域可能会有一些高温",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 263,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "到了晚上风雨是最明显的时候",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 266,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "一直会持续到星期三的清晨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 268,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "东半部以及高频的山区都有可能会出现",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 272,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "豪雨等级以上的降雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 274,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "就担心华嘉沙外围环流带来的强风豪雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 277,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "花莲万茸乡马太安溪燕瑟湖可能出现一流风险",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 281,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "花莲县府启动预防性撤离",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 284,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不过划定的影响范围过于宽广",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 286,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "初步预估一千八百户",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 288,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "元数上看七千人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 290,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "改来改去 改到最后",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 292,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "我们这些基层真的有时候会很困惑",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 296,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "到底是多少人正确的 多少人才是真的危险",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 300,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "目前我们主要做垂直撤离的一个疏散",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 304,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "主要是针对一楼的部分来去做人员的一个撤离",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 309,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "台风的威力让当地进入备战状态",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 312,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "国军全副武装待命 准备协助撤村",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 315,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "村民也陆续拿着行李来到安置所报到",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 318,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "林保署发布黄色警戒",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 320,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "周一马太安溪燕瑟湖保全户",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 323,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "以及保全范围学校三间国中小都停班停课",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 327,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因为很多都是急在人不在",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 329,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以尽量就有在家里的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 332,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "我就全部就让他们撤离来工作告辞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 335,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "气象署提醒 周一晚间到周三清晨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 338,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "花东地区宜兰以及高平山区会有猴雨以上降雨几率",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 343,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "周三虽然台风逐步远离",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 345,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "外围环流仍持续不断带来水气",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 348,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "花东以及恒春半岛不排除出现大雨",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 351,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "公视新闻温家凯竹凤竹启昌综合报道",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 355,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "台风划加沙持续逼近",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 359,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "东南部各县市不敢大意",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 363,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "台东来往绿岛 蓝雨的船班",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 366,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "昨天中午过后就停航",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 370,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "屏东东流县也宣布明后天停航",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 375,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "而10月初要登场的高雄马戏艺术节",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 380,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "工作人员也赶紧把搭好的棚架",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 384,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "降棚或拆除以确保安全",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 389,
    "duration": 7,
    "text": "果农用力拉紧往事绳索夹以固定",
    "hasSignLanguage": true
  },
  {
    "start": 396,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "正值产季的云林林内木瓜",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 398,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "产量占全国三分之一",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 400,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "之前已遭受台风接连重创",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 402,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "如今台风又来袭让农民忧心不已",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 409,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "台风划加沙持续逼近",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 411,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "21号中午以升级为强台",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 413,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "首当其冲的台东种植",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 415,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "凤梨释迦的农民更不敢大意",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 417,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一大早趁好天气赶紧修剪枝叶",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 420,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "以免风大打伤果实",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 422,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不止农民富岗与港渔民也抓紧时间",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 424,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "加固船只甚至将船调去其他地方安放",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 428,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "随着划加沙暴风半径扩大",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 433,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "不止渔船警戒交通船也受到影响",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 436,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "台东往返绿岛蓝雨的船班",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 438,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "上午过后就停航",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 440,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "码头上午出现反台人潮",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 442,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "屏东业者也赶在还有船班时",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 444,
